---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
---
<Layout title="Privacy Information" description="How the JSS Elite Group India website prepares service enquiries and uses contact information.">
  <PageHero crumbs={[{ title: 'Privacy Information' }]} eyebrow="Your enquiry details" title="Privacy" accent="information." lead="How this website handles the details you enter." />
  <section class="section"><article class="wrap prose"><h2>Preparing a service enquiry</h2><p>The enquiry form uses your name, mobile number, selected service, location and optional message to prepare a WhatsApp message in your browser. Preparing the message does not submit it to JSS Elite Group India.</p><p>You choose whether to open WhatsApp and send the prepared message. The form does not store your details in a website database or browser storage. Changing the form clears the previously prepared link.</p><h2>Contacting our team</h2><p>If you send an enquiry through WhatsApp or email, or contact us by phone, you share your contact information and requirement with our team for that conversation. Please provide only the information needed to discuss the service.</p><h2>Third-party services</h2><p>WhatsApp, your email provider and any linked social platform have their own privacy practices. This website does not embed social widgets, a map or analytics, and does not set tracking cookies as part of its enquiry form.</p><h2>Questions about your information</h2><p>To discuss information you have shared with our team, contact <a href="mailto:info@jsselitegroupindia.com">info@jsselitegroupindia.com</a> or call <a href="tel:+919711161009">9711161009</a>.</p></article></section>
</Layout>
